# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# HackaVerse Backend — Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file to .env:       cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in REQUIRED values below (marked with [REQUIRED])
#   3. DO NOT commit .env to version control
#   4. See ENV_REFERENCE.md for full documentation on every variable
#
# STARTUP BEHAVIOR:
#   - If MONGODB_URI is missing or invalid → backend starts in DEGRADED MODE
#   - If GROQ_API_KEY is missing → AI judging returns fallback scores (50/100)
#   - All other variables have safe defaults for local development
#
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE CONFIGURATION [REQUIRED for full mode]
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MongoDB connection string. Without this, backend runs in degraded mode.
# Format: mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>/<dbname>?retryWrites=true&w=majority
# Get from: https://cloud.mongodb.com → Connect → Drivers → Connection String
MONGODB_URI=

# Database name used by the application
# Default: hackaverse_db
BUCKET_DB_NAME=hackaverse_db

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI / JUDGING CONFIGURATION [REQUIRED for AI judging]
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Groq API key for AI-powered judging via LLM
# Get from: https://console.groq.com → API Keys
# Without this, judging will use deterministic fallback scores
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Groq model to use for judging
# Options: llama-3.1-8b-instant, llama-3.3-70b-versatile, mixtral-8x7b-32768
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.1-8b-instant

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# APPLICATION CONFIGURATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Author/admin password for privileged operations
# SECURITY: Change this from the default in production!
AUTHOR_PASSWORD=change_me_in_production

# Hackathon branding
HACKATHON_NAME=HackaAIverse 2025
HACKATHON_THEME=AI for Real Life

# Judging criteria (comma-separated)
JUDGING_CRITERIA=usefulness,creativity,teamwork,tech_stack,clarity
MAX_SCORE_PER_CRITERIA=10

# Event scheduling
EVENT_DATE=2025-08-15
REGISTRATION_DEADLINE=2025-08-10
SUBMISSION_DEADLINE=2025-08-15T18:00:00

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY CONFIGURATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API key for authenticating external API consumers
# Used in X-API-Key header validation
# SECURITY: Generate a unique key for production!
# Generate with: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
API_KEY=

# Secret key for request signature verification (HMAC)
# When set, enables enforced security on /workflows endpoints
# When unset, signature validation is optional
# SECURITY: Set this in production!
# SECURITY_SECRET_KEY=

# JWT secret for token signing/verification
# SECURITY: Generate a strong random secret for production!
# Generate with: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
JWT_SECRET=hackaverse-dev-secret-change-me
JWT_EXPIRY_HOURS=24

# CORS allowed origins
# SECURITY: In production, list ONLY your domains. Wildcard is auto-blocked in production.
# For TANTRA integration, add TANTRA's origin here.
# Example: "https://hackaverse-mu.vercel.app,https://tantra.example.com"
# Using "*" is ONLY acceptable for local development (ENV=development)
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BHIV INTEGRATION CONFIGURATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BHIV Core reasoning endpoint (optional)
# System gracefully degrades if unreachable
BHIV_CORE_URL=http://localhost:8002/reason

# Local bucket storage directory for logs and audit trail
BHIV_BUCKET_DIR=./data/bucket

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EMAIL CONFIGURATION (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SMTP settings for email notifications (not yet fully implemented)
SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
EMAIL_USER=
EMAIL_PASSWORD=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DISCORD WEBHOOK (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Webhook URL for sending notifications to Discord
# Get from: Discord Server Settings → Integrations → Webhooks
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FILE UPLOADS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
UPLOAD_DIR=./data/uploads
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=10
ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS=png,jpg,jpeg,gif,pdf,zip,md,txt

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FIREBASE CONFIGURATION (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
FIREBASE_KEY=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEPLOYMENT / RUNTIME
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server port (Render overrides this via $PORT)
PORT=8000

# Environment flag: "development" or "production"
ENV=development

# Data directory for JSON-based fallback storage
DATABASE_TYPE=json
DATA_DIR=data